OL,3,GNEWSABGT choir to tour farmers' mental
OL,4,Ahealth message
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who is part of a farmers' choir
OL,7,Fhopes its national tour will help
OL,8,Fspread awareness about mental health in
OL,9,Fthe agricultural industry.
OL,11,FThe Hawkstone Farmers' Choir will
OL,12,Fembark on an 18-venue tour next March,
OL,13,Fwhich includes Oxford, York and
OL,14,FBournemouth and follows its historic
OL,15,FBritain's Got Talent win in May.
OL,17,FThe choir was set up by Oxfordshire
OL,18,Ffarmer and broadcaster Jeremy Clarkson
OL,19,Fand is made up of farmers and people
OL,20,Fwith strong links to agriculture.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
