OL,3,GNEWSABGT choir to tour farmers' mental
OL,4,Ahealth message
OL,5,
OL,6,FGwen Woodruffe, from Hampshire who is
OL,7,Fpart of the choir, said: "We're
OL,8,Ftravelling throughout England,
OL,9,FScotland, and Wales... hopefully it'll
OL,10,Fmake people realise that if they need
OL,11,Fsomeone to talk to, they can, there's
OL,12,Fplaces to go."
